    'For complaints and requests you can contact info@teshvikiye.com, +90 507 600 6124 or the WhatsApp support line. In case of dispute, applications may be made to the Consumer Arbitration Committees at the Buyer\'s place of residence or at the place of the transaction, within the monetary limits announced yearly by the Ministry of Trade, and to the Consumer Courts above those limits. By completing the order the Buyer acknowledges having read this form and having received the pre-contractual information.',
